OL,3,GNEWSACorporate manslaughter charge
OL,4,Aafter man's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA company has been charged with
OL,7,Fcorporate manslaughter in connection
OL,8,Fwith the death of a man who suffered
OL,9,Fserious injuries while at work.
OL,11,FPaul Johnson, 45, was injured at a
OL,12,Fpremises in Wireless Hill, South
OL,13,FLuffenham, Rutland, on 15 April 2021,
OL,14,Fwhile working on behalf of Green Steel
OL,15,Fand Cladding Ltd, Leicestershire Police
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FHe died in hospital the following day,
OL,19,Fthe force added.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
